    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you love cats? How about a bit of chaos, strategy, and cuteness all mixed together?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you\u2019re in the right place. Run your own little cat business, team up with uniquely talented feline friends, grow your production \u2014 and make some money along the way. It may look adorable on the surface\u2026 but beneath it lies a system that rewards smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/3af29ebb9839dd26b7125ea5d8f9a8d7.avif?t=1748957426\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Thematic Neighborhoods</strong> \u2013 Explore levels inspired by cities like Istanbul, Rome, New York, and Beijing. Each region highlights its own unique cat breeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Limited Space, Endless Possibilities</strong> \u2013 Make the most of a compact game board. Every tile matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Cycle-Breaking Spirits</strong> \u2013 Special spirits can turn the tide of a match \u2014 but triggering them takes skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Cat Collection</strong> \u2013 Dozens of cats inspired by breeds from around the world, each with unique passive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Shops, Treats &amp; More</strong> \u2013 Personalize your system with special items that boost your production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Gold &amp; Rent System</strong> \u2013 Optimize your income and don\u2019t forget to pay your rent... or you\u2019ll be out on the street!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Synergy &amp; Interaction</strong> \u2013 The way your cats interact can make or break your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/cf4e7a3ac4cf164ee167a0e083c51e9a.avif?t=1748957426\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A bit of peace, a bit of order \u2014 and a shedload of fur-covered economy.</strong>In this neighborhood, everyone finds their own way.\u00a0<strong>Are you ready to find yours?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/19a95f9f97727830279017b4f5455c8a.avif?t=1748957426\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss the cutest corner of the neighborhood. Add it to your wishlist!</p>",
