 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/cf4e7a3ac4cf164ee167a0e083c51e9a.avif?t=1748957426\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A bit of peace, a bit of order \u2014 and a shedload of fur-covered economy.</strong>In this neighborhood, everyone finds their own way.\u00a0<strong>Are you ready to find yours?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449130/extras/19a95f9f97727830279017b4f5455c8a.avif?t=1748957426\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss the cutest corner of the neighborhood. Add it to your wishlist!</p>",
